FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Tu viens d'une autre ville, toi aussi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ouais, apparemment le coin est
assez connu, pas vrai ?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Sen de başka bir kasabadan mı geldin?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bilmiyordum ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} demek burası popüler bir
gezi noktası, ha?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Cómo mola este pueblo!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Parece que todos los vecinos
saben disfrutar de la vida.

EN:
So you also live in another town?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Let us outsiders stick together and
become good friends,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
Ah, anche tu vivi in un'altra città?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Due forestieri come noi devono per
forza essere amici,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I'm here visiting town!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} and I'm just
enjoying my camping trip.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It must be nice to live here. It's got
a really laid-back sorta vibe to it.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
I like that in a town,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kasabayı ziyarete geldim!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} kamp gezimin tadını çıkarıyorum.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Burada yaşamak güzel olmalı. Rahat,
telaşsız bir havası var.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Bir kasabada böyle bir şeyi severim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
No esconderé más la exclusiva:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 
voy a mudarme a {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}dentro de poco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Por si no lo sabías, {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} ha
sido {{TAG:000E:0005:040065006C0004006C006100}} artífice de todo el tinglado.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me pasaré a saludar en cuanto
me mude.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Hasta pronto!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Outdoor food is the best!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}I think what makes it even
better is the fresh air!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Because the air is so clean,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} the food
just tastes much better than usual,
don't you think,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡La comida al aire libre sabe mejor!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Estoy seguro de que es debido
al aroma de las flores.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿No te parece,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Açık havada yemek en iyisi!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Bence asıl güzelleştiren temiz hava!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hava bu kadar temiz olunca{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} yemek
de normalden çok daha lezzetli geliyor,
sence de öyle değil mi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Beim Zelten hier in {{TAG:0005:0005:}} ist
mir was Seltsames aufgefallen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ich kann es nicht beschreiben, aber{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
irgendwas in dieser Stadt übt eine
gewisse Magie auf mich aus.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Zieh doch hierher!
Das bildest du dir ein.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} is so nice!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} It makes me
feel relaxed, like my hometown{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}The people seem to be nice as well.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
I guess this would be the ideal place
to live, yeah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
You should move here!
It's not so special.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} çok güzel!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Bana kendi
kasabamdaymışım gibi
rahat hissettiriyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
İnsanları da hoş görünüyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Sanırım yaşamak için ideal yer burası,
değil mi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Buraya taşınmalısın!
O kadar özel değil.
